<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Alaska, San Miguel win semifinal games.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Alaska, San Miguel win semifinal games.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of semifinal round games on Tuesday in the Philippine Basketball Association third conference, which includes American imports:</p>
<p>Alaska Milk beat Formula Shell 102-83 (57-37)</p>
<p>(Alaska leads best-of-five series 1-0)</p>
<p>San Miguel Beer beat Ginebra San Miguel 94-88 (40-48)</p>
<p>(San Miguel leads best-of-five series 1-0)</p>
</text>
